{"test_cases_lookup_map": {"{\"actual_output\": \"Here are the latest PUP Taguig campus updates, news, and announcements: \\n \\n- **President's Weekly Update:** Catch the latest from President King, covering key campus news, upcoming events, and important highlights to keep you informed about what's happening on campus. \\n- **Campus Update:** Stay connected with campus activities, news, and events through the official campus website. You can also share feedback or suggestions via the campus feedback form. \\n- **Upcoming and Ongoing Events:** Featured and ongoing activities at PUP Taguig include Mr. and Ms. Freshman, CSID Christmas Celebration Showcase, SPADE, Career and Job Fair, Campus Orientation Week, Valentine's Day Campus Celebration, Enrollment Assistance Program, Community Outreach Program, Mental Health Awareness Month, and Leadership Training. The Foundation Anniversary Celebration is also a major annual event recognizing campus achievements and service to the community. \\n \\nFor more details and the latest updates, you may visit the [official events page](https://puptweb.isaxbsit2027.com/events).\\n\\n\", \"context\": null, \"expected_output\": null, \"hyperparameters\": null, \"input\": \"what is the latest campus updates news and announcements\", \"retrieval_context\": null}": {"cached_metrics_data": [], "cached_classifications": []}, "{\"actual_output\": \"The information about upcoming and ongoing events at PUP Taguig comes directly from the official PUP Taguig website and its knowledge base. The campus regularly features and announces events such as Mr. and Ms. Freshman, CSID Christmas Celebration Showcase, SPADE, Career and Job Fair, Campus Orientation Week, Valentine's Day Campus Celebration, Enrollment Assistance Program, Community Outreach Program, Mental Health Awareness Month, Leadership Training, and the Foundation Anniversary Celebration. These are listed under the campus's official news and events section and are part of the scheduled and ongoing activities for students and the campus community.\", \"context\": null, \"expected_output\": null, \"hyperparameters\": null, \"input\": \"where did you get the information that theres an upcoming and ongoing events\", \"retrieval_context\": null}": {"cached_metrics_data": [], "cached_classifications": []}, "{\"actual_output\": \"Here are the published news and announcements available on the PUP Taguig website: \\n \\n- You can stay updated with campus activities, news, and announcements by visiting the official campus homepage and events page. \\n- The website provides sections for campus updates, event highlights, and important announcements for students and the campus community. \\n- For submitting your own news or announcements for publication, there is a dedicated form available on the website. \\n \\nFor the most recent and detailed news and announcements, please visit the [PUP Taguig Campus homepage](https://puptweb.isaxbsit2027.com/home) or the [Events page](https://puptweb.isaxbsit2027.com/events).\", \"context\": null, \"expected_output\": null, \"hyperparameters\": null, \"input\": \"what is the published news and announcement in the website\", \"retrieval_context\": null}": {"cached_metrics_data": [], "cached_classifications": []}, "{\"actual_output\": \"I couldn't find that information on the PUP-T website. Please contact this email: taguig@pup.edu.ph for more information.\", \"context\": null, \"expected_output\": null, \"hyperparameters\": null, \"input\": \"news and announcement not events\", \"retrieval_context\": null}": {"cached_metrics_data": [], "cached_classifications": []}}}